WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Timing belt
What it does: Preserves the angular relationship between crankshaft and camshaft and drives the water pump.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Timing belt
How it works: The teeth transmit motion without intended slip.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Timing belt
How it moves: Its teeth travel around a closed loop, maintaining the 2:1 crankshaft-to-camshaft relationship.
